WEBVTT

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:17.760
Up you come.
Would you like a cup of tea?

00:00:20.054 --> 00:00:23.166
Now, focus on a fixed point
and try again.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.768
Expelliarmus.

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:29.820
Very good. Keep your concentration.

00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:33.908
Great.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.715
A little higher.

00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:44.620
Whoa!

00:00:45.663 --> 00:00:47.711
I'm okay. I'm okay.

00:01:06.559 --> 00:01:09.145
- Stupefy.
- Stupefy.

00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:11.647
Those wishing to join

00:01:11.814 --> 00:01:14.066
the Inquisitorial Squad
for extra credit...

00:01:14.233 --> 00:01:16.611
...may sign up
in the high inquisitor's office.

00:01:17.278 --> 00:01:18.905
Diminuendo.

00:01:24.827 --> 00:01:29.123
Working hard is important, but there's
something that matters even more:

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.500
Believing in yourself.

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:33.794
- Expelliarmus.
- Levicorpus. Got it.

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:35.546
Think of it this way.

00:01:35.713 --> 00:01:38.777
Every great wizard in history
has started out...

00:01:40.092 --> 00:01:43.330
...as nothing more
than what we are now: students.

00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:47.099
If they can do it, why not us?

00:01:57.193 --> 00:01:58.986
- Stupefy.
- Expelliarmus.

00:02:01.155 --> 00:02:02.531
Expelliarmus.

00:02:05.243 --> 00:02:06.744
Expelliarmus.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.626
Reducto.

00:02:27.139 --> 00:02:30.101
- Expelliarmus.
- Expelliarmus.

00:02:30.268 --> 00:02:32.645
Expelliarmus.

00:02:36.524 --> 00:02:38.067
Expelliarmus.

00:02:42.446 --> 00:02:45.105
Fantastic, Neville. Well done, man.

00:02:47.451 --> 00:02:49.620
So that's it for this lesson.

00:02:49.787 --> 00:02:52.290
Now, we're not gonna be meeting again
until after the holidays.

00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:56.227
So just keep practicing on your own
as best you can.

00:02:56.794 --> 00:03:00.172
And well done, everyone.
Great, great work.

00:03:04.969 --> 00:03:06.387
Well done, mate.

00:03:06.554 --> 00:03:07.972
Thanks.

00:03:13.686 --> 00:03:15.122
See you after Christmas.

00:03:25.489 --> 00:03:27.533
See you in the Common Room, Harry.

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.214
-Thanks a lot, Harry.
-No worries.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.331
Merry Christmas.

00:03:33.497 --> 00:03:35.791
- Thank you so much.
- Not at all. Merry Christmas.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.627
- Thank you, Harry.
- Thank you. Merry Christmas.

00:03:38.794 --> 00:03:40.671
- Merry Christmas.
- Have a good Christmas.

00:03:40.838 --> 00:03:42.934
- Have a great Christmas, Luna.
- We've been thinking.

00:03:43.361 --> 00:03:46.010
We could always slip Umbridge
some Puking Pastilles.

00:03:46.218 --> 00:03:48.846
Or Fever Fudge. They give you
massive, pus-filled boils--

00:03:49.013 --> 00:03:50.895
Sounds great, guys.
Would you excuse me?

00:04:02.485 --> 00:04:06.748
Are you all right? I heard Umbridge
gave you a rough time the other day.

00:04:07.365 --> 00:04:08.832
Yeah. I'm okay.

00:04:10.451 --> 00:04:12.135
Anyway, it's worth it.

00:04:18.584 --> 00:04:20.734
It's just, learning all this...

00:04:22.546 --> 00:04:25.118
...makes me wonder whether,
if he'd known it....

00:04:26.175 --> 00:04:28.006
Cedric did know this stuff.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.039
He was really good.

00:04:32.515 --> 00:04:34.467
It's just, Voldemort was better.

00:04:39.772 --> 00:04:41.565
You're a really good teacher, Harry.

00:04:42.858 --> 00:04:44.828
I've never been able
to stun anything before.

00:04:54.912 --> 00:04:56.580
Mistletoe.

00:05:00.084 --> 00:05:01.412
Probably full of Nargles, though.

00:05:03.087 --> 00:05:04.157
What are Nargles?

00:05:05.464 --> 00:05:06.666
No idea.

00:05:29.238 --> 00:05:30.889
Well, how was it?

00:05:32.199 --> 00:05:33.381
Wet.

00:05:34.368 --> 00:05:35.640
I mean, she was sort of crying.

00:05:36.495 --> 00:05:37.646
That bad at it, are you?

00:05:38.622 --> 00:05:40.635
I'm sure Harry's kissing
was more than satisfactory.

00:05:44.211 --> 00:05:46.050
Cho spends half her time
crying these days.

00:05:46.547 --> 00:05:48.561
You'd think a bit of snogging
would cheer her up.

00:05:50.342 --> 00:05:51.977
Don't you understand
how she must be feeling?

00:05:57.558 --> 00:06:00.390
Well, obviously
she's feeling sad about Cedric...

00:06:01.187 --> 00:06:03.833
...and confused about liking Harry
and guilty about kissing him...

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.381
...conflicted because Umbridge might
sack her mum from the Ministry...

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.502
...and frightened of failing her OWLs
because she's worrying about everything.

00:06:13.491 --> 00:06:16.177
One person couldn't feel all that.
They'd explode.

00:06:17.244 --> 00:06:19.368
Just because you've got
the emotional range of a teaspoon....

00:06:35.352 --> 00:06:37.023
Harry.

00:06:46.732 --> 00:06:48.958
Voldemort may be after something.

00:06:49.986 --> 00:06:52.299
Something he didn't have last time.

00:06:54.323 --> 00:06:55.574
Harry.

00:06:57.201 --> 00:06:58.494
Harry.

